{"h":3395,"lines":[{"x":0.080115985314298546,"t":"talent, but clients often say that more than this, it's the chance to create lasting relationships","c":1,"w":0.73277165730794269,"h":0.018581436435802789,"y":0.10556100450518158},{"w":0.40946502685546871,"y":0.12354651150669915,"t":"with other like-minded people that's the main draw.","x":0.080246910329651186,"c":1,"h":0.013084819375836831},{"h":0.014563987898180697,"w":0.71399175008138027,"y":0.14680232544834948,"c":1,"x":0.080246923193822678,"t":"Let me give you some examples of BC Travel activity holidays. Our painting holidays take"},{"h":0.019654057191594854,"y":0.15996460131721579,"t":"place in four different centres in France and Italy and they're very popular with clients of all","x":0.080148310627833341,"c":1,"w":0.72240076700846356},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.73662551879882809,"y":0.17579505307881016,"t":"abilities from beginners onwards. We've got an excellent team of artists to lead the classes -","c":1,"x":0.080246911240634988},{"x":0.080152939041226431,"y":0.19079038955220839,"w":0.74094502766927084,"h":0.01748170448276265,"c":1,"t":"some of them have been with us from the start, and five additional ones will be joining us this"},{"x":0.078093379196578064,"w":0.5557777913411458,"h":0.018015590236380663,"c":1,"t":"year so that we can offer a greater number of classes in each centre.","y":0.20587710557111238},{"w":0.73883931477864584,"x":0.078118740746808163,"t":"As far as cooking holidays are concerned, I know a lot of agents offer holidays where clients","h":0.017698309306402038,"y":0.22961700792364126,"c":1},{"y":0.24511585375205902,"t":"cook recipes related to one particular country, usually the one they're staying in, but we focus","x":0.078127355149936004,"h":0.016963803726034565,"c":1,"w":0.74295049031575522},{"h":0.017286041178888545,"c":1,"y":0.26048017620248698,"x":0.078126165067010422,"t":"on dishes from a great many different ones. Apart from that you'll find the usual emphasis","w":0.71207417805989581},{"w":0.72633743286132812,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.080246921282516537,"c":1,"t":"on good quality, organic ingredients - that's more or less a given nowadays - and there are","y":0.27761627894906915},{"x":0.078189301945853912,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"generally some meat-free recipes included.","y":0.2921083630031267,"w":0.34979423522949216,"c":1},{"t":"Our photography holidays take place in a wide range of countries from Iceland to Vietnam,","h":0.01823509090499964,"c":1,"y":0.31464443556921506,"w":0.72236765543619785,"x":0.078118422180060348},{"t":"and clients have the opportunity to see some stunning scenery. Groups are small, no more","x":0.078039307881859657,"w":0.72046284993489584,"y":0.32814144607228246,"h":0.021184168659475366,"c":1},{"h":0.018385558021644322,"x":0.076061503104021613,"y":0.34405525947180804,"t":"than eight, so clients can have one-on-one tuition during the holiday, and excursions are","w":0.70386128743489584,"c":1},{"t":"arranged with fully-trained guides. At the end of each holiday an exhibition is held of the","y":0.35999809545727302,"x":0.078066462401482781,"c":1,"w":0.69776982625325523,"h":0.019040320029107161},{"y":0.37625532752742874,"t":"photographs taken so that clients can see one another's work and receive valuable feedback","c":1,"w":0.7408407084147135,"h":0.016309844871853496,"x":0.076088121012852339},{"t":"from the tutor.","h":0.013667963699682262,"c":1,"x":0.075851582967513209,"w":0.11798508961995444,"y":0.39225808524557915},{"h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1,"t":"Finally, let me tell you about our fitness holidays. In freland and Italy we run one-week","x":0.076131676078048632,"y":0.43895348823771219,"w":0.68312759399414069},{"w":0.68742553710937504,"h":0.017903112269964327,"c":1,"x":0.076040669559755122,"y":0.45321160569193641,"t":"general fitness classes for all ages and levels of fitness. Clients start the course with a"},{"t":"consultation with a trainer, and together they draw up an individual programme. As well as","w":0.71617823282877602,"x":0.076069813557935698,"y":0.4691543763439,"h":0.017087664564871763,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"improving general fitness, clients find that they end up losing much of the stress they've built","h":0.01774700061452128,"x":0.073990045434685597,"y":0.48456254218601025,"w":0.74089029947916674},{"h":0.015738791655595441,"t":"up in their daily lives.","w":0.17326229095458984,"c":1,"x":0.07391200872502679,"y":0.49892994514874101},{"y":0.52312580778291551,"t":"In Greece, we have a two-week holiday for clients who want to do something about their.","h":0.016684419274751283,"x":0.073981171634129053,"w":0.70800155639648432,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"weight. This has all the features you'd expect, like a personalised diet programme, but one","x":0.073976914477146355,"y":0.53775577203722325,"w":0.72242752075195305,"h":0.019302222136193037},{"w":0.74095753987630208,"c":1,"t":"of its most popular features is that the exercise classes are all held on the beach. People say","x":0.073978934890701467,"y":0.55339168240065206,"h":0.018313660076846761},{"w":0.28641426086425781,"y":0.56812676380847804,"x":0.073881172640906906,"t":"it's far preferable to being in a gym.","h":0.017941425489733431,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.71623586018880214,"x":0.073980608363060765,"t":"Finally, we offer several holidays in Morocco. One very popular one is the mountain biking","y":0.5920494071734792,"h":0.018002471878896364},{"w":0.72016459147135414,"t":"holiday. Bikes are provided and there are different routes according to people's ability. We","x":0.072016469577870335,"c":1,"h":0.016048292108362783,"y":0.60895170803266685},{"t":"offer one which is tailored to the needs of families, which is particularly popular.","x":0.071954145773659661,"h":0.016788310802446249,"y":0.62347941130914919,"c":1,"w":0.63594904581705725},{"t":"OK, so that's about all the time I have today, so thank you very much...","y":0.6468023254172206,"x":0.072016466184848957,"c":1,"w":0.57201644897460946,"h":0.016036308275094724},{"x":0.074074075854994537,"w":0.15432098388671872,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"y":0.70494186032454564,"t":"SECTION 3"},{"x":0.061677464348401066,"c":1,"t":". NATALIE: Dave, I'm worried about our case study. I've done a bit of reading, but I'm not sure","y":0.73246427350360321,"h":0.01648940410995936,"w":0.73674316406250007},{"c":1,"t":"what's involved in actually writing a case study - I missed the lecture where Dr","h":0.018260275096017131,"y":0.74793949871103016,"w":0.62983403523763026,"x":0.14186838660411638},{"y":0.76442873988380744,"w":0.20987654368082684,"x":0.14609053463795049,"h":0.011778563015312216,"c":1,"t":"Baker talked us through it."},{"t":"DAVE:","x":0.072016460566993998,"y":0.7819767440869132,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"w":0.043209877014160167},{"w":0.66893112182617176,"t":"OK, well it's quite straightforward. We've got our focus - that's tourism at the Horton","y":0.77855488081152391,"h":0.01788190565345138,"c":1,"x":0.14392601886712414},{"x":0.14394644994330993,"c":1,"y":0.79477513923885723,"h":0.015108494371070424,"w":0.47547073364257808,"t":"Castle site. And you said you'd done some reading about it."},{"y":0.8123909833300863,"t":"NATALIE:","w":0.061809984842936191,"x":0.069918052739179379,"h":0.011845940274259892,"c":1},{"y":0.82703488347108911,"w":0.041152261098225923,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"x":0.069958848411792396,"t":"DAVE:"},{"c":1,"y":0.84293247747187516,"h":0.010355975237555493,"t":"NATALIE:","w":0.063843555450439446,"x":0.067872460891181138},{"t":"DAVE:","x":0.072016460129573967,"w":0.039094651540120443,"c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.85901162780438289},{"c":1,"y":0.80954272653561787,"t":"Yes, I found some articles and made notes of the main points.","h":0.016218517919030395,"x":0.13983699378227055,"w":0.50017069498697919},{"h":0.016616857234384219,"x":0.14190181881775213,"y":0.82550285081754482,"c":1,"t":"Did you remember to keep a record of where you got the information from?","w":0.60096750895182294},{"w":0.40534978230794272,"y":0.84156976732014066,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Sure. I know what a pain it is when you forget that.","x":0.14403292764697748},{"x":0.14396520039290542,"w":0.65034790039062507,"h":0.016031580341999585,"t":"OK, so we can compare what we've read. Then we have to decide on a particular","c":1,"y":0.85488266478828401},{"h":0.01863966055556654,"y":0.87102512419947031,"x":0.14187018412828242,"c":1,"w":0.67511581420898437,"t":"problem or need at our site. And then think about who we're going to interview to get"},{"w":0.14443803151448567,"h":0.01301330166514536,"y":0.88680778379306413,"c":1,"t":"more information.","x":0.14387466910878591},{"t":"leltsresources.org","h":0.016454192297478354,"w":0.20824633280436194,"y":0.96768258536995222,"x":0.39483721299237268,"c":1},{"w":0.061728394826253252,"t":"Test 7","h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"y":0.063898704191031941,"x":0.86008230454160584},{"x":0.83539094794749813,"t":"Q13 &","h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.10895170789791964,"c":1,"w":0.05555555343627927},{"t":"Q14","h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"y":0.12499999984156696,"x":0.83539094710560224,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"x":0.83333333401918264,"w":0.037037035624186143,"y":0.23255813935192304,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q16"},{"y":0.34883720914629723,"t":"Q17","c":1,"x":0.83127571939454881,"w":0.039094651540120484,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"t":"Q19","y":0.52616279053924131,"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.82921810761228965,"c":1},{"x":0.8271604930628158,"w":0.039094651540120484,"t":"Q20","h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"y":0.61191860449727187},{"y":0.82848837193699465,"t":"Q21","w":0.037037035624186143,"x":0.82716049442465345,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"x":0.87242798436897695,"t":"107","y":0.93604651135194283,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1}],"w":2400}